@WorkFlow_API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7040

@systemAdminToken = COLE_AQUI_O_ACCESS_TOKEN
@tenantAdminToken = COLE_AQUI_O_ACCESS_TOKEN
@projectManagerToken = COLE_AQUI_O_ACCESS_TOKEN
@memberToken = COLE_AQUI_O_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Cadastrar empresa

POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Testes111",
  "registrationNumber": "REG-API-001222233e",
  "email": "empresa-api@test.local",
  "phone": "(47) 99999-9999"
}

### Tentar cadastrar empresa com nome vazio

